




╭─ Help ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│Move (NORMAL)                                           Compose (INSERT)                                              │
│  j/↓         move down (newer)                           Enter       send                                            │
│  k/↑         move up (older; loads history at the top)   A-Enter/C-j new line                                        │
│  g           go to the top                               Esc         back to NORMAL / close the thread               │
│  G           go to the newest                                                                                        │
│  h/←         pane to the left                          Find, search, react                                           │
│  l/→         pane to the right                           /           search messages in this workspace               │
│  Tab         next pane                                   r           react to the selected message                   │
│  S-Tab       previous pane                               ↓/C-n       next (j too in search results)                  │
│                                                          ↑/C-p       previous (k too in search results)              │
│Conversations                                             Enter       pick                                            │
│  Enter       open conversation / thread of message                                                                   │
│  1–9         switch workspace                          Commands (COMMAND)                                            │
│  C-k/C-t     find a conversation in any workspace        :q              quit                                        │
│  C-b         show or hide the sidebar                    :open <name>    open a conversation by name (#general, @ana)│
│  <           narrower sidebar                            :help           this help                                   │
│  >           wider sidebar                               :search <query> search messages in this workspace           │
│                                                          :react <emoji>  react to the selected message (:react +1)   │
│Modes                                                                                                                 │
│  i           write a message (INSERT)                                                                                │
│  :           command line (COMMAND)                                                                                  │
│  Esc         back to NORMAL / close the thread                                                                       │
│  ?           this help                                                                                               │
│  q           quit                                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                      │
│Press any key to close.                                                                                               │
